# PageMate — Cursor project intelligence

## Product
- Name is **PageMate**.
- Dark-first PWA with a light theme toggle (sun/moon switch).
- Local demo must work with zero env vars. Supabase is opt-in.

## Architecture rules
- UI reads **only** from `useSessionStore`. Never fetch Supabase from a component.
- Persistence goes through `SyncAdapter` (`local-adapter` | `supabase-adapter`).
- Page turns: optimistic Zustand → `debounceMutex` 420ms → adapter. Persist the **latest** page, not every tap.
- Identity: email + password. Local adapter stores salted SHA-256 hashes and issues an HMAC session token (`pagemate-access-token`). Same email keeps the same user, pair, and buddy code.
- Sign out is confirmed in a modal. Forgot-password emails go through Resend (`RESEND_API_KEY` server-only, `app/api/auth/forgot-password`). Reset links land on `/reset-password?token=`. Supabase reset remains available when configured.
- UI reads **only** from `useSessionStore`. Never fetch Supabase from a component.
- Do not cache `/api/*` or cross-origin in `public/sw.js`.
- Push send lives in `app/api/push/send/route.ts` (Node runtime, not Edge). `web-push` + VAPID private key stay server-side.
- iOS Web Push requires Home Screen / standalone. Install prompt on iOS is a tutorial, not `beforeinstallprompt`.

## Design
- Colors: canvas `#0F172A`, brand `#6366F1`, accent `#F59E0B`, cream `#F5F0E8`.
- Logo: `components/branding/PageMateLogo.tsx` (two overlapping pages / infinity). Do not replace with a raster favicon-only mark.
- Fonts: Outfit (UI) + Fraunces (display) + Vazirmatn (Persian/Arabic). `dir="auto"` / `.pm-bidi` put Vazirmatn first. Outfit/Fraunces use `adjustFontFallback: false` so Arabic glyphs are not swallowed by the Latin fallback.
- Share **a book** (`/join/{code}?book={id}` via `ShareBookButton`). Do not share the account from Settings.
- Theme: `useThemeStore` + `ThemeSwitch` (CSS sun/moon). Persist `pagemate-theme`. Settings shows the switch only under Appearance (not also in the header). Visible on auth, pairing, home, library, and activity.
- Local demo pairs are mirrored to `GET/PUT /api/pairs/[code]` (`.data/pairs.json`) so Incognito on the same Next server can join. PUTs merge; clients poll every 2s so page turns stay live. Same URL/port in both windows.
- Bottom nav + `env(safe-area-inset-bottom)`. Touch targets ≥ 44px.
- Glass: `.glass` / `.glass-strong` in `app/globals.css`. Light theme overrides live on `html.light`.

## Docs
When changing debounce, RLS, SW, or push, update `docs/ARCHITECTURE_AND_IMPLEMENTATION.md` in the same change.
